by janedbal at 2026-03-12T10:37:19Z

Main usecase is imo exception propagation, for example:

```php
$cache->get(
     "key",
     function (ItemInterface $item): void {
         $item->expiresAfter(300);
         throw new CheckedException(); // with param-immediately-invoked-callable, this is propagated to call-site and need to be handled
     },
);
```

[More about checked exceptions in PHPStan](https://phpstan.org/blog/bring-your-exceptions-under-control)
